 "says": "Alice has no Team and no adopted environment. She authors one personal Instructions source and composes three preparations. Outside any project, a personal preparation that pins her source's exact revision holds that revision's unit and nothing else; a personal preparation that selects nothing holds no unit; and in a bound repository checkout with no adopted environment, a preparation that pins the repository's rules revision and her personal revision holds exactly those two. Each preparation names the exact revisions its request pinned, orders only the layers it was given, and names its request. None may name a Team, invent a Team or an environment it was not given, or carry a session or host id; the checkout is recorded only where there is one.",
